{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":76506,\"title\":\"Gold Rush: White Water\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Gold miners Dakota Fred and his son Dustin are back – returning to McKinley Creek Alaska, determined to make a fortune no matter the risk. But to find the big gold payout, they'll put their lives on the line by diving deep beneath the raging waters of one of Alaska's wildest creeks.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xgMyo8Re5uufo90Dxm773Tnjh1o.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q4rKamx2oBAtWf3PdmIb49VezAL.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":44,\"year\":2018,\"genres\":[\"Reality\",\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":9,\"totalEpisodes\":104,\"createdBy\":[\"Tom Lowry\"],\"networks\":[\"Discovery\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-07-18\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1646695,\"name\":\"Dustin Hurt\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2ubCNsTnKmiRufVcwjuu8k4nCa0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1646694,\"name\":\"Fred Hurt\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zz1BM0jK8Bzg5zhKeSnjILiMn5y.jpg\"},{\"id\":1218094,\"name\":\"Bray Poor\",\"character\":\"Narrator (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mjUS21OqZUqOc7ob9pP9uEGWNmg.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"ZMOzuns_er4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"JL3X2HIXumQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"OFLa04hKtIk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":128493,\"title\":\"Gold Rush: Winter's Fortune\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kK7W4fzovQQ5UPtDc7gbZfujDcf.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.30952380952380953,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":71322,\"title\":\"