\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-11\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"When Bears Attack\",\"overview\":\"A hungry and aggressive apex predator tears through the miners' camp, forcing the crew members to come together to find a solution; the crew uses new equipment to speed up their gold recovery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cInHMXZvcdPFbhW64Gg2mSOP5cD.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-18\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Too Close for Comfort\",\"overview\":\"Fred and Dustin disagree on where to find the gold and dig separate holes. But, a fierce confrontation jeopardises the entire operation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8qajrHd2KFKBUcaV7kGwOqwrnZU.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-25\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Nugget Trap\",\"overview\":\"The Dakota Boys finally discover a rich nugget trap but inadvertently risk the life of a crew member.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oJMEumfAxGB6q3XYx0hprRSohBh.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-01\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"McKinley, We Have A Problem\",\"overview\":\"Finding their biggest gold nugget of the season is a great sign, but soon enough heavy rain means flooding, and, despite the danger, the Dakota Boys still go out and dive.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pjTfRjI4tT3ul61HUZrSi5avA5T.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-08\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Sacrifice & Sabotage\",\"overview\":\"After being rescued from the water, Dustin is forced to look for a new mine site due to the flood, but he soon finds out that the McKinley site may not be a lost cause after all.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nC62CoadgdzpRpbti9pkc2mnzR8.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-15\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Landslide\",\"overview\":\"Digging deeper than ever, the crew sees no sign of the promised bedrock gold; just when the crew starts to question Dustin's leadership, his determination pays off.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w70TBMW63FER1D5C4Ejm5aPVBsI.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-22\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Widow Maker\",\"overview\":\"The Dakota boys are dredging towards a nugget trap they believe holds a jackpot of gold. After a rough season, this could this be the life-changing fortune they desperately need.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/astUjOkapkFzP85lskW8m4EBhYC.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-01\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Gold Strike\",\"overview\":\"The group cleans up and does a final gold weigh-in for the season. Meanwhile, Dustin leads the crew to a new mine site that quickly proves to have huge potential.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k5CewQb2gakRqk6JqfuvBHMErJt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-08\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Diving Deeper\",\"overview\":\"The Dakota Boys and their crew members reflect on their wild season and look ahead to what's next.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/itvptDHSOqDsVUifPOkY5CqTCRW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-22\",\"runtime\":42}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2018-01-19\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}